{"id":17531,"artist":"No vuelvo a amar","title":"Ranchera","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:30.25] No vuelvo a amar\n[00:34.25] con tan profundo anhelo,\n[00:42.00] ni a cautivar\n[00:46.00] mi vida en las pasiones.\n[00:50.75] No vuelvo a amar\n[00:54.50] a tan crueles corazones,\n[01:02.50] no vuelvo a amar\n[01:06.50] jamás, jamás, jamás.\n[01:15.75] Porque el amor\n[01:20.88] es una ave pasajera\n[01:27.50] que se anida\n[01:32.63] y entorpece el pensamiento.\n[01:36.25] No vuelvo a amar\n[01:40.00] Ni  a sentir lo que ahora siento;\n[01:48.00] no vuelvo a amar\n[01:52.13] jamás, jamás, jamás.\n[02:14.50] Porque el amor\n[02:19.75] es una ave pasajera\n[02:26.25] que no anida\n[02:31.50] y entorpece el pensamiento.\n[02:35.13] No vuelvo a amar\n[02:38.75] ni a sentir lo que ahora siento;\n[02:46.88] no vuelvo a amar\n[02:50.88] jamás, jamás, jamás.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:30.25] <00:30.25>No <00:31.00>vuel <00:31.25>vo <00:31.37>a <00:31.50>a <00:31.62>mar\n[00:34.25] <00:34.25>con <00:34.62>tan <00:35.75>pro <00:36.12>fun <00:37.12>do <00:37.50>a <00:37.62>nhe <00:39.00>lo,\n[00:42.00] <00:42.00>ni <00:42.12>a <00:42.75>cau <00:43.00>ti <00:43.37>var\n[00:46.00] <00:46.00>mi <00:46.37>vi <00:47.50>da <00:47.62>en <00:47.87>las <00:48.87>pa <00:49.25>sio <00:50.00>nes.\n[00:50.75] <00:50.75>No <00:51.50>vuel <00:51.87>vo <00:52.00>a <00:52.12>a <00:52.25>mar\n[00:54.50] <00:54.50>a <00:54.75>tan <00:55.12>crue <00:56.25>les <00:56.62>co <00:57.75>ra <00:58.12>zo <00:59.62>nes,\n[01:02.50] <01:02.50>no <01:03.25>vuel <01:03.62>vo <01:03.75>a <01:03.87>a <01:04.00>mar\n[01:06.50] <01:06.50>ja <01:06.87>más, <01:08.00>ja <01:08.37>más, <01:10.62>ja <01:11.37>más.\n[01:15.75] <01:15.75>Por <01:16.50>que <01:16.87>el <01:17.12>a <01:17.25>mor\n[01:20.87] <01:20.87>es <01:21.25>u <01:21.62>na <01:21.75>a <01:22.00>ve <01:22.37>pa <01:22.75>sa <01:23.12>je <01:24.50>ra\n[01:27.50] <01:27.50>que <01:28.25>se <01:28.62>a <01:29.00>ni <01:29.75>da\n[01:32